data bergamo_9754_vintage: VintageCandidate = VintageCandidate {
  id: "bergamo-9754-1u",
  description: "EPYC Bergamo 9754-class 1U: 128 Zen 4c cores, SP5, 12-channel DDR5. ~200 equivalents at ~450 W wall (planning). The x86 successor vintage; Aug-09 doc already rules it watch-don't-buy.",
